<!-- Mission Section -->
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="mission-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-split">
      <div class="about-split-text">
        <span class="section-label">Our Mission</span>
        <h2 id="mission-heading">Structured Preparation, Genuine Results</h2>
        <p>Cracking India's competitive exams demands consistent, high-quality practice. MockOrbit provides full-length mock tests that mirror the actual exam experience — the same pattern, duration, and question style — so you know exactly where you stand before the real test.</p>
        <p>We are starting with AIBE XXI and expanding to CLAT, Judiciary, UPSC, SSC CGL, and Current Affairs. Every series we launch will be accurate, complete, and aligned with the latest official syllabus.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-split-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="about-visual-card">
          <div class="about-visual-icon">🎯</div>
          <div class="about-visual-title">Focused Practice</div>
          <div class="about-visual-desc">Questions aligned to the exact pattern and syllabus of your target exam</div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-visual-card">
          <div class="about-visual-icon">📊</div>
          <div class="about-visual-title">Real Analytics</div>
          <div class="about-visual-desc">Topic-wise scores, all-India rank, and percentile after every attempt</div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-visual-card">
          <div class="about-visual-icon">📖</div>
          <div class="about-visual-title">Clear Explanations</div>
          <div class="about-visual-desc">Every answer comes with a detailed explanation of the reasoning or provision</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Story Section -->
<section class="section bg-soft" aria-labelledby="story-heading">
  <div class="container container-sm">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">Our Story</span>
      <h2 id="story-heading">Built to Close the Preparation Gap</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content-prose">
      <p>Quality mock test content for competitive exams has always been scattered, expensive, or incomplete — especially for students outside major cities. MockOrbit was created to change that.</p>
      <p>We started with AIBE XXI because it is a mandatory qualifying exam for every law graduate who wants to practise in India — yet comprehensive, well-structured mock tests for it have been hard to find. Our full-length mock covers all 19 topics across 380 questions, matching the official exam pattern.</p>
      <p>We are a new platform, and we are growing. Our goal is to build an honest, reliable preparation tool — one exam at a time, done properly. CLAT, Judiciary, UPSC, SSC CGL, and Current Affairs series are already being developed and will be added soon.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Values Section -->
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="values-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">What We Stand For</span>
      <h2 id="values-heading">Our Core Values</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎯</div>
        <h3>Accuracy First</h3>
        <p>Every question is verified against the latest exam notifications and official syllabus. We do not publish content we are not confident about.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔍</div>
        <h3>Full Transparency</h3>
        <p>We show you exactly where you stand — your rank, percentile, and topic-wise breakdown. No inflated numbers, no false reassurances.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">🤝</div>
        <h3>Genuine Support</h3>
        <p>Real people respond to your queries. Reach us at hello@mockorbit.com or call us Monday–Saturday, 9 AM – 6 PM IST.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon" aria-hidden="true">💡</div>
        <h3>Continuous Improvement</h3>
        <p>We update our content based on changing exam patterns and user feedback. If you spot an error, tell us and we will fix it promptly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

